or change tasks, goals, plans, settings, subscriptions and calendar events in one sentence, each with Undo. Outgoing messages (email, DMs) are only drafted for you to send yourself.…","Feed. Reports rather than raw posts. A daily AI brief: new models, papers picked for your taste from arXiv and Hugging Face, open source, industry news, trends and a line per lab you follow, every item linked to its…"],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TimeLovercc/mojito/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"59001860b57144646bf021a4551b0439b8d54b11c7fb3d5be6172b4656b2c0fc","extractedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.499Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.499Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Mojito — the local, evolving alternative to cloud personal AI like Meta Muse.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TimeLovercc/mojito/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"No account and no server; it resets when you reload.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TimeLovercc/mojito/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"59001860b57144646bf021a4551b0439b8d54b11c7fb3d5be6172b4656b2c0fc","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TimeLovercc/mojito/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.499Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-05T03:08:19Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/TimeLovercc/mojito/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-05T19:22:04.501Z","hash":"59001860b57144646bf021a4551b0439b8d54b11c7fb3d5be6172b4656b2c0fc","originalBytes":31816,"storedBytes":31816,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["app","hub","code","agent","claude","mac","what","chat","docs","web","maintainer","next","one","own","push","feedback","repo","worker","data","server","today","android","change","desktop","every","ask","each","loop","only","calendar","design","new","mojito","ship","source","token","computer","how","through","anything","changes","rednote","ships","add","any","copy","daily","english","feed","goes"